title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/file:seek
catalog: GUI command
target: file:seek
summary: File: seek the previewed media by a signed number of seconds

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``file`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``left`` → ``file:seek -10`` (in the ``file`` panel)
* ``right`` → ``file:seek +10`` (in the ``file`` panel)
* ``shift+left`` → ``file:seek -60`` (in the ``file`` panel)
* ``shift+right`` → ``file:seek +60`` (in the ``file`` panel)
